OL,3,GNEWSAIrishman charged with destroying
OL,4,AUS military aircraft with axe
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS officials have charged an Irishman
OL,7,Fwith destroying a $60m (#45m) American
OL,8,Fmilitary aircraft after he allegedly
OL,9,Fsneaked onto the tarmac of an airport
OL,10,Fin Ireland.
OL,12,FDaithi O'Corrain, 48, is accused of
OL,13,Fdoing extensive research before he
OL,14,Fallegedly used chemicals and various
OL,15,Ftools - including an axe - to damage a
OL,16,FUS Air National Guard C-130 Hercules
OL,17,Fparked at Shannon Airport near
OL,18,FLimerick.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
