OL,3,GNEWSAIrishman charged with destroying
OL,4,AUS military aircraft with axe
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmerican prosecutors have charged him
OL,7,Fwith destruction of government
OL,8,Fproperty, which carries a maximum
OL,9,Fsentence of 10 years in prison.
OL,11,FO'Corrain is not currently in US
OL,12,Fcustody, according to the Associated
OL,13,FPress news agency, and it is unclear
OL,14,Fwhether he has a lawyer who could speak
OL,15,Fon his behalf.
